# sds-lane-landing-ledger's schedule: one pass daily at 07:30, as the Mac job's
# `StartCalendarInterval` runs it (`scripts/com.devon.landing-ledger.plist`), in the image's
# America/New_York time. The ledger takes no scheduled-pass flag: every run but `--dry-run` records
# and arms the dead-man switch. The entrypoint runs this file only when LANE_SCHEDULE_ENABLED is
# `true`.
30 7 * * * lane-run landing-ledger
